Callosum (callo)
Copyright 2026 Peculiar Ragdoll. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The package (the wheel and the sdist) is Apache-2.0 and contains no third-party data. Its licence expression is
"Apache-2.0".

Data derived from third-party datasets lives in the source repository only, and in the Hugging Face dataset
peculiar-ragdoll/callo-bias-set (https://huggingface.co/datasets/peculiar-ragdoll/callo-bias-set), which callo
fetches on first use:

- bench/data/bias_set.jsonl: the built-in position-bias calibration set, builtin-v1 (MMLU and BANKING77; also the
  file published in the Hugging Face dataset);
- bench/data/bias_heldout_v1.jsonl: its held-out remainder (MMLU and BANKING77);
- bench/data/wide_items.jsonl: the wide-choice validation items (BANKING77 and CLINC150).

These files carry the MIT, CC-BY-4.0 and CC-BY-3.0 licences in the sections below.

